=3D"--MarkdownRenderer_streaming-fade-duration: 750ms;"><p>No, I wasn't stu=
ck! I had created all the game files in my previous session, but they weren=
't committed to the repository. I've now properly committed everything in c=
547a6f.</p>
<p>The game is fully functional with:</p>
<ul>
<li>4 playable characters with unique abilities</li>
<li>5 weapon types with distinct behaviors</li>
<li>Advanced enemy AI with 6 behavioral states (patrol, chase, attack, hide=
, flank, retreat)</li>
<li>Side-scrolling camera system</li>
<li>Power-ups and pickups</li>
<li>Campaign and Survival game modes</li>
<li>Full UI with menus, HUD, and game state management</li>
</ul>
<p>You can play it by opening index.html in a browser!</p>
